@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@authToken = REEMPLAZAR_TRAS_LOGIN

### Listar personajes
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters
Accept: application/json

### Ruta no existente (prueba de errores con el contrato API)
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters-not-found
Accept: application/json

### Atacar personaje (caso correcto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/attack
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "attackerId": 1,
  "targetId": 2
}

### Atacar personaje (error: mismo atacante y objetivo)
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/attack
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "attackerId": 1,
  "targetId": 1
}

### Atacar personaje (error: atacante no existe)
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/attack
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "attackerId": 999,
  "targetId": 2
}

### Resetear HP de todos los personajes
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/reset
Accept: application/json

### Registro de usuario
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@batalla.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Login de usuario
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "user1@batalla.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Esto guarda el token global
> {%
  client.global.set("authToken", response.body.data.access_token);
%} 

### Listar personajes (con token - preparado para JwtAuthGuard)
GET {{baseUrl}}/characters
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Atacar personaje (con token - preparado para JwtAuthGuard)
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/attack
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "attackerId": 1,
  "targetId": 2
}

### Atacar personaje (error de validación DTO)
POST {{baseUrl}}/characters/attack
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "attackerId": 1,
  "targetId": 2,
  "extraField": true
}
